---
// IntroducingOsvauld.astro - Section introducing Osvauld
---

<section
  class="py-16 px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center bg-dark1"
  id="introducing-osvauld"
>
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] w-full">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center md:text-left">
      <h2 class="text-blue1 section-heading mb-12">
        Introducing <span class="text-white">osvauld</span>
      </h2>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
        <div>
          <h3 class="custom-content-title mb-4">Connect any two devices on the planet</h3>
          <p class="custom-content-text-gray">
            Encrypted, peer-to-peer connections without servers or surveillance.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <h3 class="custom-content-title mb-4">Full Ownership & Absolute Privacy</h3>
          <p class="custom-content-text-gray">
            You control and own your connections, not corporations. Secure with cryptographic keys you hold, no third party can 
            lock you out, access or take them away.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
